Usage: agentctl wait [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -f, --file <PATH>
  -v, --verbose
      --generation <GENERATION>
      --for <CONDITION>            [default: ready] [possible values: accepted, observed, ready, paused, stopped, deleted]
      --timeout-seconds <SECONDS>
  -h, --help                       Print help
